  "description": "Winner of the 2nd MrBlue Comic Contest.\n\nA sharp-tongued chef vs. a self-styled power blogger—their fiery war of words begins!\n\nNabillio (Seungyoon), a power blogger with wit as sharp as his pen, is known for his bold takes on Italian cuisine. After hearing rumors that a restaurant he once criticized has improved, he decides to pay it another visit. \n\nBut wait—why does the chef look so familiar?\n\nIt’s a showdown between a digital-nomad blogger and an old-school chef, with pasta—and maybe more—on the line!",
